# Feature: Sketch, punching & sample execution

## Sketch
- Version upload, assignment, expected vs. actual hours.
- Routes to Design Head for Sketch Approval.

## Punching / Wilcom
- Upload EMB/DST files with stitch counts and machine format metadata.
- Assigned puncher, version tracking.

## Sample development
- Material requirement raised, fabric/components issued.
- Machine Operator runs the sample: machine details, output, wastage recorded.
- Sample received back for checking (see `15-feature-approval.mdc` handoff to
  Sample Checker).

Each of the above is its own `DesignTask` and follows the timer state machine
in `17-feature-timer-dashboard.mdc`. File type/size limits: reference image
10MB, sketch PDF/image 25MB, EMB/DST 50MB (keep original filename + checksum),
video 200MB, audio 25MB.
